          "title": "Markdown",
          "type": "Markdown",
          "content": "<p class=\"govuk-body\">I confirm that:</p>\n<ul class=\"govuk-list govuk-list--bullet\">\n<li> I will adhere to the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/rye-harbour-boat-registration/rye-harbour-registration-terms-and-conditions\" class=\"govuk-link\">Rye Harbour registration terms and conditions</a> </li>\n<li> The boat will always have a current harbour dues disc on display</li>\n<li> I will let the harbour master check the length of the boat</li>\n<li> I will contact the harbour office immediately if any of my details change</li>\n<li> I will use the boat detailed in this form in Rye Harbour and pay harbour dues</li>\n<li> I will abide by the byelaws and legislation in force in Rye Harbour and will comply with all directions given by the harbour master in the execution of their duties</li>\n</ul>",
